<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE task PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Task//EN" "task.dtd">
<task id="term_management_usage" xml:lang="zh-CN">
    <title>日常术语操作指南</title>
    <taskbody>
        <context>本节介绍如何在文档编写过程中高效处理术语。</context>
        <steps>
            <step>
                <cmd><b>术语识别</b>：在 <uicontrol>Term Recognition</uicontrol> 标签页点击
                        <uicontrol>Scan</uicontrol>。使用 <uicontrol>Toggle Highlight</uicontrol>
                    可在正文中高亮显示术语。</cmd>
            </step>
            <step>
                <cmd><b>右键快捷操作</b>：在文档中选中词汇，右键点击 <uicontrol>Term Management</uicontrol>：</cmd>
                <choices>
                    <choice>新词：选择 <uicontrol>Quick Add</uicontrol> 存入术语库。</choice>
                    <choice>已有词：选择 <uicontrol>Insert Translation</uicontrol> 插入译文或 <uicontrol>Edit
                            Term</uicontrol> 修改词条。</choice>
                </choices>
            </step>
        </steps>
        <postreq>
            <note type="caution">若选中内容包含多个术语，右键菜单将不显示操作选项。请确保每次仅选中一个术语进行处理。</note>
        </postreq>
    </taskbody>
</task>